ion-1771304567214\",\"position\":2,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-analyst-vs-data-engineer\/#faq-question-1771304567214\",\"name\":\"2. Who is a Data Engineer?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"A data engineer is responsible for building and managing the systems that collect, store, and organize data. They create data pipelines that help you access clean and structured data for analysis and reporting across different business platforms.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-analyst-vs-data-engineer\/#faq-question-1771304581358\",\"position\":3,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-analyst-vs-data-engineer\/#faq-question-1771304581358\",\"name\":\"3. What coding skills are most important for data analysts?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"To start your career as a data analyst, you should learn basic coding skills like SQL and Python. These help you retrieve, clean, and analyze data from databases to generate useful insights for better business decisions.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-analyst-vs-data-engineer\/#faq-question-1771304596185\",\"position\":4,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-analyst-vs-data-engineer\/#faq-question-1771304596185\",\"name\":\"4. Who earns more, a data scientist or a data engineer?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Generally, a data scientist earns slightly more than a data engineer because they work with machine learning, data analysis, and statistical modeling. However, actual salary may vary depending on experience, location, technical skills, certifications, company size, and industry demand.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\